  "code" : "public int uniquePathsWithObstacles(int[][] grid) {\n    int m = grid.length, n = grid[0].length;\n    int[][] dp = new int[m][n];\n    for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) {\n        for (int j = 0; j < n; j++) {\n            if (grid[i][j] == 1) {\n                dp[i][j] = 0;\n            } else if (i == 0 && j == 0) {\n                dp[i][j] = 1;\n            } else {\n                int fromAbove = i > 0 ? dp[i - 1][j] : 0;\n                int fromLeft = j > 0 ? dp[i][j - 1] : 0;\n                dp[i][j] = fromAbove + fromLeft;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    return dp[m - 1][n - 1];\n}",
